Z||000000||Boomtastic||06-11-2001||05:04 AM||||All -<P> It appears that an individual named Steve Wood from 8309 Sunnyside Ct., Manassas, VA<BR>20111 has taken orders from numerous people for decals, but has yet to deliver then goods. There is talk about contacting the FBI's Internet crime department for help with getting everyone's money back. Please let me know either off the forum if you have had dealings (good/bad/otherwise) with Steve Wood/Pegasus Decals/EscapePodGames@aol.com/cooldroidr2d2@aol.com. You can email decals@boomtastic.com. You can also send questions there too. All information will be treated privately, but not anonymously. Thanks in advance!||||reg||5
